# ===== 通用日志 / 监控前缀 =====
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,applog.*
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,analytics.*
DOMAIN-REGEX,^logs?\..+$
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,mon.*
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,rtlog*.*
# 遥测（含 telemetry.microsoft.com、incoming.telemetry.mozilla.org 等）
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,telemetry.*
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.telemetry.*

# ===== 小红书（新增，你的命中第 3、6、11 名）=====
